<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 800 mln of fixed bonds Sept 19.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 800 mln of fixed bonds Sept 19.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry is offering 800 million zlotys worth of 16-percent two-year bonds and 12-percent five-year bonds at an auction for institutional investors on September 19, the central bank said.</p>
<p>There are no quotas reserved for each of the papers maturing October 12, 1998 and October 12, 2001.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
